---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Admission Policy - Upgrade Infotech"
  description="Terms and conditions, admission policy, and refund policy for Upgrade Infotech SAP Training."
>
  <Header />
  
  <main class="flex-grow bg-slate-50 py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-heading mb-8 tracking-tight border-b border-slate-100 pb-6">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-body font-medium leading-relaxed">
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Admission Policy</h2>
            <p>Cancellation of admission is only possible within 24 hours, with an 18% deduction in registration fees for payments made by card, cheque, or NEFT.</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Payment of fees by cheque, credit card, debit card, or NEFT, Cash includes an 18% GST. Any future increases in GST will be borne by the students.</p>
            <p class="mt-2">Bounced cheques require an additional payment of 500/-.</p>
            <p class="mt-2">After 24 hours of enrollment, no refunds will be given under any circumstances. Admission remains valid for 90 days. If the course doesn’t commence due to insufficient enrollment or unexpected reasons, a full refund will be issued. Book fees are non-refundable. Refunds are processed within 21 days.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Study Material</h2>
            <p>Study material is provided upon full payment of the course fees.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Transfer</h2>
            <p>Batch transfers are not allowed except taken approval. Transfer of admission is non permissible.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Certificate Correction</h2>
            <p>Any corrections to the certificate should be requested within 15 days of issuance, incurring a penalty of Rs 1500/-.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Library</h2>
            <p>Late return of library books incurs a penalty of Rs 50/- per day.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Damage</h2>
            <p>Students are responsible for bearing the cost of any damage caused to the institute’s property.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Attendance</h2>
            <p>Students are expected to be punctual and regular. Absence from a class incurs an additional fee of Rs 750/- per hour for make-up classes.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Examination</h2>
            <p>Exams take place at the branches on scheduled dates. Once finalized, dates cannot be changed. Failure to attend or pass an exam incurs a re-examination fee of Rs 1050/-.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> No Certificate</h2>
            <p>Non-attendance of exams results in no issuance of certificates or attendance certificates.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Bonafide Certificate</h2>
            <p>A minimum of 75% attendance is required for the issuance of a Bonafide Certificate.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Communication</h2>
            <p>All communication between students and the institute is conducted by the institute’s authorized personnel via phone or WhatsApp group. The institute is not responsible for any student losses due to negligence. For lecture or faculty-related queries, contact info.upgradeinfotech.com or call 7021348186.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Certificate Collection</h2>
            <p>Students must collect their certificates in person, within two months of the exam. The institute holds no responsibility for certificates after this period.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Duplicate Certificate</h2>
            <p>In case of a lost/misplaced certificate, a duplicate can be issued for Rs 1500/-.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Mobile Usage</h2>
            <p>During class, cell phones must be switched off or put on silent mode. The institute is not responsible for any loss or theft of mobile phones on the premises.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Late Fee Payment</h2>
            <p>Fees are subject to change from timely manner. Students are required to pay their course fees on or before the due date. In case of failure to clear the due fees on time, a late payment fine of Rs 500/- per day will be applicable until the outstanding amount is paid in full.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-heading mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-primary">▪</span> Training & Placement Assistance</h2>
            <p>The institute is committed to providing quality training and extends placement assistance to eligible students on a best-effort basis, including resume building, interview preparation, and connecting students with hiring partners. However, placement assistance is not a guarantee of employment, and the institute does not commit or assure any student a guaranteed job or placement, as final selection depends on the student's own skills, performance, and the requirements of the hiring companies.</p>
          </section>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
